{
  "id": "bigville_deed",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville R55 (block 366000): LAND OWNERSHIP is managed by the CLERK and the BANK with DEEDS -- the FORMAL, institutional version of the recognition thesis. ld_clerk_authority: the Clerk's authority = Count(recognizers) -- its register is authoritative only insofar as the office is recognized. ld_record: the clerk enters a submitted Deed into the REGISTER (register -has_deed-> deed); land ownership is now WHAT THE REGISTER RECORDS (a squatter with no registered deed does not own the plot -- the register decides). ld_transfer: a sale/gift/bequest -- the clerk records the new owner; ownership FOLLOWS the register (unrecorded -> the old owner still holds it). ld_foreclose: the BANK holds a mortgaged deed (in its dual-key safe); on default it FORECLOSES (the clerk records the bank as owner). The register's authority rests on the recognized clerk's office -- formal recognition on top of the informal Count(recognizers) of bigville ownership. Composes with bigville_clerk_treasurer (the clerk keeps the records), bigville_recognition (the clerk's office), bigville_coin_safe (the bank's deed vault), and bigville_will (land bequeathed = a deed transfer the clerk records).",
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": [],
  "productions": [],
  "concepts": [],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "ld_clerk_authority",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "The Clerk's authority = Count(recognizers). The register is authoritative only insofar as the office is.",
      "match": [
        [
          "town",
          "has_clerk",
          "clerk"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "Lit",
        "value": true
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "clerk",
          "authority",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Count",
              "source": {
                "type": "InNeighbours",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "clerk"
                },
                "edge_type": "recognizes"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ld_record",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "LAND OWNERSHIP IS BY DEED, RECORDED BY THE CLERK: the clerk enters a submitted Deed (deed -submitted_to-> register) into the REGISTER -- register -has_deed-> deed, deed.registered=1. Ownership is now what the register records. Requires a RECOGNIZED clerk (authority>=1) -- an unrecognized clerk's register has no authority.",
      "match": [
        [
          "town",
          "has_clerk",
          "clerk"
        ],
        [
          "town",
          "has_register",
          "register"
        ],
        [
          "deed",
          "submitted_to",
          "register"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "clerk"
                  },
                  "key": "authority"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 1.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Not",
            "arg": {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "deed"
                    },
                    "key": "registered"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "add_edge",
          "register",
          "has_deed",
          "deed"
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "deed",
          "registered",
          1.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ld_transfer",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Transfer of land (sale/gift/bequest): the CLERK records the new owner on the registered deed (deed.owner <- transfer_to). Ownership FOLLOWS the register -- until the transfer is recorded, the old owner still holds it. Requires a recognized clerk.",
      "match": [
        [
          "town",
          "has_clerk",
          "clerk"
        ],
        [
          "register",
          "has_deed",
          "deed"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "clerk"
                  },
                  "key": "authority"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 1.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Not",
            "arg": {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "deed"
                },
                "key": "transfer_to"
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": ""
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "deed",
          "owner",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "deed"
              },
              "key": "transfer_to"
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "deed",
          "transfer_to",
          ""
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ld_foreclose",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "The BANK holds a mortgaged deed (deed -pledged_to-> bank, kept in the bank's dual-key safe). On DEFAULT (deed.defaulted=1) the bank FORECLOSES -- the clerk records the bank as owner (owner <- bank.name). The register still decides; the bank now holds the land.",
      "match": [
        [
          "town",
          "has_clerk",
          "clerk"
        ],
        [
          "register",
          "has_deed",
          "deed"
        ],
        [
          "deed",
          "pledged_to",
          "bank"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "clerk"
                  },
                  "key": "authority"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 1.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "deed"
                  },
                  "key": "defaulted"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 1.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Not",
            "arg": {
              "type": "Eq",
              "a": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "deed"
                    },
                    "key": "foreclosed"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 1.0
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "deed",
          "owner",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "bank"
              },
              "key": "name"
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "deed",
          "foreclosed",
          1.0
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "deed",
          "defaulted",
          0.0
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}